  m_text: 'Kaidao Kaijeaw Kaiwan Kaikon HewAh - Game Designer

    Steamed Egg Lovers
    Association - Game Designer

    Nutcharee Sumeruwai - Game Designer

    PANDA
    - Game Designer (Gameplay, UX/UI)


    Natcha Chansamathi - Character Design,
    Art Dinosaur, Alcohol Manager

    Mach Wannawanit - Prop Design & UI

    passivepong
    - Technical Character Animator Artist

    Crispy shrimp - Sea creature

    jtwoenteen
    - 3D Artist

    Akio - Necromancer/Puppeteer

    ---------------------------

    ---------------------------



    DJ
    Yoshi499 - Unity Crasher

    NongKratha - Programmer

    ---------------------------'
